---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageDocument from '../../../components/PageDocument.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - neben" backUrl="/en/">
  <PageDocument title="Privacy Policy">
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <p>neben ("the App") is built to respect your privacy. This policy explains how the App handles data – the short version: your data stays on your device.</p>

    <h2>Who Is Responsible</h2>
    <p>The controller within the meaning of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is Dennis Hartrampf, neuro / dev, Priorter Dorfstr. 33, 14641 Wustermark, Germany. Further details are available in the <a href="/en/legal-notice-impressum">legal notice</a>.</p>

    <h2>Information the App Processes</h2>
    <p>The App works without an account and processes only the data it needs to function:</p>
    <ul class="custom-list">
        <li><strong>Your retreat:</strong> The selected room and companion, unlocked room items and accessories, and the focus minutes that lead to these unlocks are stored locally on your device. The App does not store a history of your sessions or statistics about your behavior.</li>
        <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Settings such as the intervals of the self-care impulses and your sound mix are stored locally on your device.</li>
        <li><strong>Purchase status:</strong> Whether the full version has been unlocked is stored locally on your device so that the App also works offline.</li>
        <li><strong>Rating prompt:</strong> So that the App asks for a rating only rarely, it remembers locally when it last asked.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No Servers, No Tracking, No Ads</h2>
    <p>All of this data is stored <strong>exclusively locally on your device</strong>. I do not operate any servers for the App, and I do not collect, transmit, analyze or store your personal information. The App contains no advertising, no advertising ID and no analytics or tracking tools.</p>
    <p>The App does not access your camera, microphone, photos, contacts or location, and it does not read which other apps you use.</p>

    <h2>Background Playback and Screen</h2>
    <p>So that the ambient sounds keep playing when you briefly switch apps, the App plays them as background media playback. On Android, the system shows a discreet media notification for this, which is why the App asks for the notification permission. The App does not send promotional or reminder notifications. The screen stays on during a session. No data is processed or transmitted for this.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>The App uses an internet connection only through the following app store services:</p>
    <ul class="custom-list">
        <li><strong>Google Play Billing (Android) / Apple In-App Purchase (iOS):</strong> Processes the optional one-time purchase of the full version and restores it when needed. Google or Apple process and manage all payment information according to their own privacy policies. I never receive your payment details or your name. The App only learns from the store whether the full version has been unlocked and stores this locally.</li>
        <li><strong>In-app rating:</strong> After a few sessions, the App may use the rating feature of Google Play or Apple to ask whether you would like to rate it. The rating is processed directly by the respective store; I do not learn whether or how you rated the App.</li>
        <li><strong>App stores:</strong> When you download or update the App, Google Play or the Apple App Store process data under their own privacy policies. I have no influence on this and receive at most anonymous, aggregated statistics (e.g. number of installs).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Note on nalua</h2>
    <p>After a session, the App may point you to my breathing app nalua. On Android, the App checks only on your device whether nalua is installed; this information never leaves your device. Only when you tap the note does nalua or its app store page open.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Because your data never leaves your device, you have full control:</p>
    <ul class="custom-list">
        <li>Clear the App's data through your device settings to remove all locally stored information. A purchase you have already made stays tied to your store account and can be restored.</li>
        <li>Uninstall the App at any time to remove it and all associated local data from your device.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Under the GDPR you also have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection, as well as the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority. As I do not store any personal data about you, there is usually nothing I could disclose or delete – but feel free to ask.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>I may update this privacy policy from time to time, for example when the App changes. The current version is always available on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or the App, please contact me at:</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:android-support@neurodiv.dev">android-support@neurodiv.dev</a></p>
  </PageDocument>
</BaseLayout>
